  "system": {
    "source": {
      "custom": "",
      "book": "RAINTDM",
      "page": "",
      "license": "",
      "rules": "2024",
      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<h3>Features</h3><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Mastery Property (Topple)</strong></p><p>If you hit a creature, you can force it to make a Constitution saving throw (DC 8 + your Proficiency Bonus + your Strength modifier). On a failed save, the creature has the Prone condition.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Power Charge</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p><p>As a Bonus Action, you begin winding up the hammer. The weapon remains charged for 1 minute, until you hit with an attack using it, until you are knocked Prone, or until you are Incapacitated. While charged, your walking speed increases by 5 feet, and your next successful attack with this weapon deals an extra [[/r 2d6]] bludgeoning damage <em>(Charge Upgrade I)</em>.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Mighty Weapon</strong></p><p><strong>Special.</strong></p><p>Once per turn when you hit a creature in the head (or just hit it) with a charged attack, you can unleash the built-up kinetic energy to rattle their brain. The target must make a Constitution saving throw (DC 8 + your Proficiency Bonus + your Strength modifier). On a failed save, the creature is Stunned until the end of your next turn. A Huge or larger creature has Advantage on the saving throw. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, regaining all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest (tracked as this weapon's <strong>Limited Uses</strong> — open the item and lower <em>Spent</em> to restore a use after a rollback).</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #0070dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Charge Upgrade I</strong></p><p>Your Power Charge now deals an extra [[/r 2d6]] bludgeoning damage on a hit.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #0070dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Upswing / Spinning Bludgeon</strong></p><p>Your charged attacks gain tactical versatility. When you hit a creature with an attack empowered by your Power Charge, you can choose one of the following additional effects:</p><ul><li><strong>Upswing:</strong> The target is pushed 10 feet away from you. If they hit a solid object (like a wall or another creature), they take an additional [[/r 1d6]] bludgeoning damage.</li><li><strong>Spinning Bludgeon:</strong> You carry the momentum into a spin. Choose a second creature within 5 feet of the original target; you can immediately make one melee weapon attack against the second creature (this second attack does not benefit from the charge's extra damage).</li></ul></div>",
      "chat": "<div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Mastery Property (Topple)</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Power Charge</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Mighty Weapon</strong></p><p><strong>Special.</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #0070dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Charge Upgrade I</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #0070dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Upswing / Spinning Bludgeon</strong></p></div>"
    },
